      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ccd336f6f460377a158730e"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "What is this protocol? \n\nWhat about our [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarInterdiction],Interdiction]]?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c529ffe1f0d70328caa72da"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c48f69e0ce7732ac7e37b65"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Termination of everyone involved in case of a breach. \n\nAnd she lied because the Interdiction would never have been lifted by the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComStarFirstCircuit],First Circuit]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c16070bb680455141e7d17d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cab692ebc653ba995c3d354"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "This isn't surprising, ComStar treated us as hostiles when we were attempting to rescue them from pirates back at that Deep Periphery [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMcEvedysFolly],world]].\n\nThey even chose to blow up their DropShip than allowing themselves to be captured.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ccddea3399df49f388102cd"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c0f0170e72c33f4ccc5874e"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "We have stopped the [[DM.Factions[faction_HarbingersOfDoom],Harbingers]] use of the HPG array, we can deal with ComStar later.\n\nThe Harbingers are quick to figure out the opportunities caused by our deployments and their intelligence is better than we had expected.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "What happened this time?",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c29b5dd6de3fec12105de20"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c23950593093c235d7ee93f"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "While we were busy rescuing Kamea and then denying them the use of ComStar's compound, they used the distraction to attack us again.\n\nThe Second Decimis Fusiliers engaged but without 'Mech support they were completely brushed aside, so we lost control of the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreKeonaAranoSpaceport],spaceport]].",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cc968d2b3199a4953cb6600"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": {
        "ops": [
          {
            "functionName": "Set BattleTech Viewscreen Image",
            "args": [
              {
                "int_value": 0,
                "bool_value": false,
                "float_value": 0.0,
