    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cbb2edbb76fa1c27a4fb601"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "How is this possible? \n\nWe were expecting a much lighter presence first but now it seems they when full ahead on their first landings despite keeping the <i>Orion's Belt</i> and a ton of DropShips as a reserve.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ca6a90ae9a8db3575b54081"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c3c8381133d7bc3b86f3824"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "My own 'Mech and the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreAranoRoyalGuard],Royal Guards]] were ambushed right after we left the city to reinforce the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreEspinosaRefitYards],Refit Yards]].\n\nAll of this was only possible with a lot of preparation beforehand.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c7781c231411280de9d8e74"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb505592dd387e22c6fab98"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Or just a lot of coordination because the Harbingers were waiting for our response and already preparing to it.\n\nWe have clearly misjudged their abilities and so far we have played into their hands.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 10,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c653ebc52c99265c6b84541"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c16cc27c8976674ebb9a3b0"
      },
      "index": 10,
      "text": "The battle of the Refit Yards ended barely in our favor... only two Kitten 'Mechs remain standing on their legs plus a full lance of pilot casualties.\n\nThe raiders effectively disabled the 'Mech yards, at this rate it will become impossible to do any more repairs.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 11,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c0098d29bbf19c2fbc76289"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f26230355c18000069",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ceefc63d2bd8062089364e7"
      },
      "index": 11,
      "text": "While Aurigan forces took heavy damage after the raiders had disabled the Refit Yards.\n\nAt this rate of tear and wear it will be a choice to retreat or surrender.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 12,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c4038fd2129e103e3ce5a1b"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9caade81de498a2a467026a5"
      },
      "index": 12,
      "text": "And I will do neither, Yang, we either expel the raiders from my world or I will die here fighting them.\n\nWhat are our tactical options?",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 13,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9ceb352b481769619530959d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59baac916230356416000354",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c97f0da9eab807aa85f5c86"
      },
      "index": 13,
      "text": "The Refit Yards are back in our possession but we were fortunate that our 'special ordnance' was stored in the Royal Palace for maximum safety because the raiders wrecked the facility as the Chief MechTech said.\n\nBut before anything, we need take the spaceport back to deny its use by the massed Harbinger fleet that is about to arrive at Coromodir's orbit.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 14,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cd8593ac364eabe43248d2d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b97f45623035ac140054ca",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cfc02b0228af73b1c862867"
      },
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Then we will recover it.\n\nCommander, I have an assignment for you: retake the spaceport.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "We will be ready, Lady Arano.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": -1,
